{"candidateAnswer":"In the late summer of 2022","evidence":"[D27:4 | 6:20 pm on 3 August, 2023] Maria: I started volunteering here about a year ago after witnessing a family struggling on the streets. It made me want to help, so I reached out to the shelter and asked if they needed any volunteers. They said yes, and it has been a really fulfilling experience for me since then.","itemId":"urn:uuid:4fd6c627-ed75-5858-afe3-08609f84753d","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:5ee545e4b74272d5ca7dcfd284bafe8a83d14ff54c7404be304abbabf8a765f7","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Maria start volunteering at the homeless shelter?","referenceAnswer":"Around August 2022","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"5ee545e4b74272d5ca7dcfd284bafe8a83d14ff54c7404be304abbabf8a765f7"}}]}